"""
lineage_flow_visual.py
------------------------
Standalone interactive flow visual - launched as its own process by
lineage_dashboard.py (same split as the original health_check.py /
Sheet_Trace_Visual_6.py / sheet_tree_server.py architecture).

Reads a small handoff JSON (file paths + confirmed stage/category per
sheet), re-parses formulas itself, builds the sheet-to-sheet flow graph,
and serves an interactive vis-network page:

  - Nodes colored by stage (Input / Process / Output / Unclassified),
    positioned in columns left -> right.
  - Edges: gray = normal (follows Input->Input/Process, Process->
    Process/Output), red dashed = ANOMALY (breaks that rule), purple
    dashed = touches an unclassified sheet.
  - Click a sheet box -> actually switches to that sheet in Excel via
    pywin32 COM automation (same mechanism VBA macros use) and draws
    Trace Precedents / Trace Dependents arrows on it.
  - Search box, right-click to hide/show a node, a show/hide panel with
    Show all / Hide all / Undo.

Requires:
    pip install openpyxl pywin32
    Excel must be installed for the click-to-open feature.

Usage:
    python lineage_flow_visual.py lineage_handoff.json
"""

